# Normalise line endings to LF in version control (Windows checkouts still get CRLF).
# Without this, the same file shows up as entirely rewritten on a different machine,
# burying a real one-line change under thousands of noise lines. That is exactly the
# class of problem this tool exists to help people avoid.

* text=auto eol=lf
# Binary / non-diffable files, marked so git does not try to convert them.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gz  binary
*.db  binary
